type AgentMessage {
  from: String
  text: String
}
type QuestionRef {
  question: String
  quote: String
}
call recognise-question(message: AgentMessage) -> QuestionRef?
  task recognise-question
  template
    An agent of a software team sent the mail below to the owner of the project. Does it ask the owner to decide or
    answer something, so that the agent (or the work) waits for the owner? A report, a status update or an FYI does
    not; a question the agent answers itself does not; "should I do X or Y?", "may I ...?", "which ...?" and a
    request for the owner's choice do.

    If it asks, answer with the question restated in one short line (question) and the sentence of the mail that asks
    it, copied exactly (quote). If it asks several things, take the one the owner must decide first. If it does not
    ask, answer null.

    Mail from {{ message.from }}:
    {{ message.text }}
